    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94347" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑτ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feed, fatten</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτεύεσκον
				κτήνεα</span> (
				Ion.
			
			impf.) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.119
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				375.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.661b
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.675
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				4.3
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιαίνω</span> is 
				Att.
			, Moer.<i><span class="en">
				p.332
			</span></i> P.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>supply with corn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς [ἱερὰ]ς τραπέζας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					3529
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Cnidus</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>feed on, eat</i>, c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.2.5
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτέομαι</span>
			); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτέω</span>.</div>
